{"id":"nekogda","lemma":"некогда","pos":"adv","rank":2502,"glosses":["in the old days, in former times, formerly, once"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/65/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Тому сейчас немного некогда.","en":"Tom is in a bit of a hurry now.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"a little, some"},null]},{"text":"Думать об этом было некогда.","en":"There was no time to think about this.","words":[{"g":"to think"},{"g":"about"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Мне сегодня некогда.","en":"I'm in a hurry today.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"today"},null]},{"text":"Мне сейчас некогда есть.","en":"I don't have time to eat now.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"now"},null,{"g":"there is / to eat"}]},{"text":"Тому сегодня действительно некогда этим заниматься.","en":"Tom really doesn't have time to do that today.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"today"},{"g":"really"},null,null,{"g":"to study, to learn"}]}]}